# EventEngine™ (Architecture #002)

Central nervous system. **Everything is an event.** No feature calls another feature directly.

## Rules

- Publish once via `EventEngine.publish()` — subscribers react
- Sport-agnostic: NFL/MLB/NBA register event types, engine does not know rules
- Idempotent event IDs · audit trail · retries/DLQ for reliability
- Priorities: critical → high → normal → background

## Engines (subscribe only)

RewardCore · LegacyCore · LiveCore · CommunityCore · HighlightEngine · NotificationCenter · Analytics

## Adding a feature

Register event type → publish at action site → add subscriber(s) → done

Full spec: `docs/EVENT_ENGINE.md`
